    "description": "Ordering from one app is now conveniently accessible at your fingertips through this easy-to-use ordering experience. Skip the line and wait, and be able to pick up your food, hassle-free, already paid for through this app. With customizable features, and up-to-date specials and promotions, you are sure to receive delicious meal without the hassle of calling in an order or waiting in line to place and receive your meal. With this app, large group orders are easier than ever!",
